    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 137,
    "summary": "While in captivity, the Jews wept by the rivers of Babylon—Because of sorrow, they could not bear to sing the songs of Zion.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "By the rivers of Babylon, there we sat down, yea, we wept, when we remembered Zion.",
